    "detailed_description": "Hot-blooded action game where you steal, throw, and fling discs to take down your opponents and leave your mark in the vaulted halls of Nice Disc! Up to four players can join the fray in this local multiplayer sports brawler, with both controller and keyboard support. The last one standing takes home the championship belt!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nController (X-Input)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLeft analog stick or D-pad: Movement and throwing direction<br />\r\nA: Jump<br />\r\nX: Throw disc<br />\r\nKeyboard<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWASD: Movement and throwing direction<br />\r\nSpace: Jump<br />\r\nLeft-click: Throw disc<br />\r\nYou can aim the disc in eight directions. Pick up discs from the ground by touching them when you're not already carrying one.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n1-2 players story mode and 1-4 players battle mode.<br />\r\nHigh speed original sports action<br />\r\ncomic style art",
